# Silent-send relayer env templates (never commit real keys).
#
# Create ONE file per network (gitignored):
#
#   cp .env.mainnet.example .env.mainnet    # Ethereum mainnet → port 8788
#   cp .env.sepolia.example  .env.sepolia    # Sepolia testnet  → port 8787
#
# Then:
#   npm run start:mainnet
#   npm run start:sepolia
#   npm run start:both          # both processes together
#
# Rules:
# - Different private key per network
# - Never reuse deployer / fee-recipient keys
# - Never put a Sepolia key in .env.mainnet
